cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "QCC-Transformer: bounded exact-KV decoding for long-context inference"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Marchematics
repository-code: "https://github.com/Marchematics/qcc-transformer"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A cache policy that runs an exact Full-KV prefill through a stock pretrained
  language model and compiles the decode cache down to a fixed number of slots
  per (layer, kv-head). Decode is exact softmax attention over the survivors, so
  decode state is set by configuration rather than by context length, with no
  training and no new parameters. Measured on RULER, LongBench and matched
  Full-KV baselines across four models and three model families.
keywords:
  - long-context
  - kv-cache
  - inference
  - retrieval
  - transformers
